+---
+id: dl-003-reuse-task-list-validation-for-imports
+type: decision-log
+title: "Reuse task-list validation for imports"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Bulk-imported tasks must follow the same title, priority, tag, and duplicate-title rules as tasks
+added through the existing public list API.
+
+## Decision
+
+Parse each non-blank input line into a `NewTask` and add it through `TaskList.add`. Treat an empty
+priority field as omitted so the list assigns its normal default. Report the list operation's error
+message as the rejection reason.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Imports stay behaviorally aligned with ordinary additions, including validation changes made later.
+The import helper does not need to duplicate domain validation or mutate list internals.
